abstract: >-
  Extension module of the AIDOC-AP application profile. It adds the terms needed to describe the
  stages of the AI system lifecycle that the AIDOC-AP core, which follows the technical
  documentation of Annex IV of the EU AI Act, does not cover in detail: links from lifecycle
  activities to the artefacts they use and produce, and stage-specific descriptions. The module
  imports the core without changing it.
